      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "少し遠いが、他の国の都市にも足を延ばして\nきみの踊りで元気を与えてやってほしい。\n行って欲しい場所は４箇所だ。\nそこが復興したら訪ねてやってくれ。",
        "official_en": "It's a bit of a trek, but would you head out to cities in\nthe vassal countries to invigorate people with a\ndance? There are four places I want you to visit once\nthey've been rebuilt.",
        "real_en": null
      },
